<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: "20px 72px", background: "#F5E3BE", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 122, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>难点四 · 棋子外观推翻了十几轮</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 10 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.62)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginTop: 8 }}>同一处外观被反复推翻十余次，每一次都留下一条可复用的铁律</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 510, flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: "100%", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 14 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", justifyContent: "center", gap: 8 }}>
<Box style={{ width: 158, background: "rgba(140,90,43,0.10)", borderLeft: "4px solid #8C5A2B", borderRadius: 6, padding: "12px 11px", flexDirection: "column", gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>1. v8 · 九层立体</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.72)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>球面 + 木纹 + 双圈 + 镜面光，被直接否决</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: "#B3271E", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", alignSelf: "center" }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 158, background: "rgba(140,90,43,0.10)", borderLeft: "4px solid #8C5A2B", borderRadius: 6, padding: "12px 11px", flexDirection: "column", gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>2. v9 · 扁平木片</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.72)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>推翻 3D，改素色木片 + 细描边</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: "#B3271E", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", alignSelf: "center" }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 158, background: "rgba(140,90,43,0.10)", borderLeft: "4px solid #8C5A2B", borderRadius: 6, padding: "12px 11px", flexDirection: "column", gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>3. v10 / v11</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.72)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>5 套主题 + 书法字，定下红繁黑简</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: "#B3271E", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", alignSelf: "center" }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 158, background: "rgba(140,90,43,0.10)", borderLeft: "4px solid #8C5A2B", borderRadius: 6, padding: "12px 11px", flexDirection: "column", gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>4. v13 系</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.72)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>解耦材质与配色，修字形乱码与边缘锯齿</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: "#B3271E", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", alignSelf: "center" }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 158, background: "rgba(140,90,43,0.10)", borderLeft: "4px solid #8C5A2B", borderRadius: 6, padding: "12px 11px", flexDirection: "column", gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>5. v15 · 光泽收敛</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.72)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>去点状高光，压暗定向光，定稿</Text>
      </Box>
  </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: "100%", flexDirection: "column", gap: 8 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.78)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>v9 的信息：用户要的不是「立体」，是「真实且克制」。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.78)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>v13 的信息：材质与配色必须解耦，否则组合爆炸且无法维护。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.78)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>v15 的信息：光泽要自然——宁少勿多，宁暗勿亮。</Text>
    </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", background: "rgba(42,33,24,0.94)", borderLeft: "5px solid #B3271E", borderRadius: 6, padding: "10px 20px", marginTop: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(245,227,190,0.92)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>这十几轮证明：外观打磨不是一次成型，而是靠一次次否决把边界试出来。</Text>
